**React: Overwhelming Winner** 🏆

| Category | React | Vue |
|----------|-------|-----|
| **UI Libraries** | Material-UI, Chakra, Ant Design | Vuetify, PrimeVue, Element Plus |
| **State Management** | Redux, Zustand, Jotai, Valtio |

